    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Parkour</strong> is a single-player parkour adventure set high above the clouds. Test your agility and timing across <strong>16 handcrafted levels</strong> filled with <strong>floating platforms</strong>, <strong>tricky obstacles</strong>, and satisfying jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>challenging yet calming</strong>, Relax Parkour offers a minimal, peaceful environment where you can focus purely on movement and flow. Whether you're hopping between platforms, avoiding swinging traps, or figuring out the best route forward, every level provides a fresh parkour challenge to overcome at your own pace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Parkour</strong> is a single-player parkour adventure set high above the clouds. Test your agility and timing across <strong>16 handcrafted levels</strong> filled with <strong>floating platforms</strong>, <strong>tricky obstacles</strong>, and satisfying jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be <strong>challenging yet calming</strong>, Relax Parkour offers a minimal, peaceful environment where you can focus purely on movement and flow. Whether you're hopping between platforms, avoiding swinging traps, or figuring out the best route forward, every level provides a fresh parkour challenge to overcome at your own pace.</p>",
    "short_description": "Relax Parkour is a single-player platformer with 16 handcrafted levels set in a sky-high world of floating platforms and obstacles. Enjoy calming visuals, smooth movement, and satisfying parkour challenges at your own pace.",
